# Self-hosted GitHub Actions runner install (docs/runbooks/benchmark-runner-continuity.md,
# docs/runbooks/gpu-runner-continuity.md). Operators extract this inside the repo checkout;
# it ships upstream test fixtures (e.g. astral-sh/setup-uv's intentionally malformed
# pyproject.toml) that must never be linted, formatted, or committed as Sidar source.
actions-runner/
